  "key_findings": "K923 Copula-Based Hedge Ratio Analysis (SPY hedged with GLD). Data: 2005-01-04 to 2026-04-02, 5345 obs. OOS: 2019-01-01 onward (1823 obs). SPY-GLD Pearson correlation: 0.0583 (very weak). All methods produce low HE due to weak SPY-GLD correlation. OOS best HE: DCC (0.0269). OOS best VaR5% reduction: Copula (1.0023). OOS best ES5% reduction: Copula_Quantile (0.9982). DCC vs Copula DM t-stat: -1.2736, Harvey significant: False. Copula Quantile Hedge designed to minimize tail risk, tail event analysis shows its effectiveness during 2\u03c3+ drops.",
